1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,850
A fourteen-year-old boy named James loses both of his
parents in a terrible car accident.

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,137
He moves in with his grandfather, Japetto.

3
00:00:09,137 --> 00:00:14,287
James quickly makes two friends in the neighborhood, but one
of them dies of cancer.

4
00:00:14,287 --> 00:00:17,637
The other friend moves away to a different town.

5
00:00:17,637 --> 00:00:22,925
On that very day, Japetto decides that James should never
lose anyone again.

6
00:00:22,925 --> 00:00:27,962
He spends weeks locked away in the basement, where James is
never allowed to go.

7
00:00:27,962 --> 00:00:34,325
After countless hours down there, Japetto finishes a
creation that will never abandon his grandson.

8
00:00:34,325 --> 00:00:38,713
One evening, Japetto takes James out for some fresh air.

9
00:00:38,712 --> 00:00:42,737
He promises to show him something very special the next day.

10
00:00:42,737 --> 00:00:47,200
That night, James wakes up to a strange noise in the house.

11
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:51,438
He sees a figure in the shadows and chases it down to the
basement.

12
00:00:51,438 --> 00:00:56,237
To his shock, a living puppet named Pinocchio emerges to
greet him.

13
00:00:56,237 --> 00:01:02,487
James is terrified and calls him a creepy thing, but Japetto
insists he is a real living being.

14
00:01:02,487 --> 00:01:06,263
Japetto begs James to keep Pinocchio a secret.

15
00:01:06,263 --> 00:01:11,112
Over the weekend, the two boys play together and become the
best of friends.

16
00:01:11,112 --> 00:01:15,775
Pinocchio watches a documentary about animals protecting
their herds.

17
00:01:15,775 --> 00:01:20,988
He decides that James is his herd, and that he must protect
him at all costs.

18
00:01:20,987 --> 00:01:26,087
Later, Pinocchio discovers another puppet in the basement,
the Wooden Mother.

19
00:01:26,088 --> 00:01:32,225
She tells him that to become a real boy, he needs skin,
blood, teeth, and hair.

20
00:01:32,225 --> 00:01:35,700
He must take them from others and wear them every day.

21
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:39,088
A cricket hidden in the shadows hears every word.

22
00:01:39,088 --> 00:01:42,475
Pinocchio asks James to take him to school.

23
00:01:42,475 --> 00:01:46,800
James hides him in his bag and sneaks him past his
grandfather.

24
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:51,712
At the gym, Pinocchio slips out and watches the adults
exercise.

25
00:01:51,713 --> 00:01:57,413
A woman notices him, falls from her treadmill, and is
crushed by the falling weights.

26
00:01:57,412 --> 00:02:02,837
Then the bullies, Trey and Logan, find James and destroy his
toys.

27
00:02:02,838 --> 00:02:06,738
They mock him and threaten to kill him if he ever tells
anyone.

28
00:02:06,737 --> 00:02:12,125
James whispers that he wishes all those teens were dead, and
Pinocchio hears him.

29
00:02:12,125 --> 00:02:17,438
That night, Pinocchio decides to make every one of James'
wishes come true.

30
00:02:17,438 --> 00:02:21,887
At the dentist, Pinocchio watches James suffer in pain.

31
00:02:21,887 --> 00:02:27,887
On the way home, a distracted driver crashes the car, and
James ends up in the hospital.

32
00:02:27,887 --> 00:02:33,162
Pinocchio learns that the crash was caused by a drunk driver
who has hurt many people.

33
00:02:33,162 --> 00:02:37,775
To protect his best friend, Pinocchio hunts the drunk driver
down.

34
00:02:37,775 --> 00:02:41,500
He rips the organs out of the man to make himself real.

35
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:44,938
Then he goes after the dentist and takes her teeth.

36
00:02:44,938 --> 00:02:49,750
James and his friends watch old tapes and uncover the truth
about Japetto.

37
00:02:49,750 --> 00:02:54,450
Their grandfather was trying to cheat death by trapping
souls in puppets.

38
00:02:54,450 --> 00:02:59,287
James realizes that Pinocchio is now hunting everyone who
ever hurt him.

39
00:02:59,287 --> 00:03:04,062
Pinocchio attacks Logan's house and kills his friends at the
swimming pool.

40
00:03:04,062 --> 00:03:09,262
He hunts down Amanda, and then Trey, ending them in
horrifying ways.

41
00:03:09,262 --> 00:03:14,675
James begs Pinocchio to stop, but Pinocchio thinks he wants
him to kill more.

42
00:03:14,675 --> 00:03:18,875
By the time Japetto returns home, Pinocchio is gone.

43
00:03:18,875 --> 00:03:23,088
James realizes the puppet will never stop trying to protect
him.

44
00:03:23,088 --> 00:03:27,075
And that is the story of a boy who brought a monster to
life.

